5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long rooms stay out of service during construction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The initial budget figures rarely match the final cost after the building opens.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I am worried that the approved numbers do not survive contact with the real market.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same tired staff keep absorbing every new burden. I need to see who is actually left to maintain these places.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, that is a valid concern. But I want to see if the projects we built actually satisfied the users.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, satisfaction is important, but I need to know the downtime. How long are rooms unusable during the work?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, downtime is a symptom. I need to see the tender records to understand where the budget actually went.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, exactly. I want to see the renewal reserve too. It shows what we actually spend after the building opens.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, the reserve is just a number. I need to know if the people maintaining it are still standing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, I understand the urgency of downtime. But without knowing if the final result was actually useful, we might just be fixing the wrong things.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, usefulness is vital, but if the space is unusable for months, the academic calendar suffers. I need the timetable records to quantify that loss.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, usefulness is nice, but I need to know why the calendar slips. I will check the delivery schedules by project rationale.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I will check the survey findings in the older blocks to see the real condition.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, schedules are just paper. I need to see the actual workload. I will check the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the post-occupancy review ratings to see which projects truly served their users.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records on rooms out of service. I also need the booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the tender records over three budget cycles. I also need the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I will check the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. I also need the survey findings in the older blocks to see the real condition.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the staffing posts since the hiring freeze. I also need the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see the real load.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
