71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, precisely. The data shows general rooms are in constant demand. Candidate A directly addresses that shortage, ensuring high utilization and justifying the capital spend.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
